oved to give the game a better look !InterfacesI redesigned all the interfaces to give them a better look and make them feel smoother than before.New Skin SystemThe skin system has been completely reworked as ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T16:32:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3503350-1835236783560430","game_id":"steam-3503350","kind":"update","title":"0.1 Fixes and Update","summary":"BEHHHHH !Hi everyone,Here’s a mid-update featuring several fixes and improvements for both the demo and the full game.UPDATES :Added 14 additional languages.Added a sound effect in Stick the Bomb when a player receives the bomb.Reduced the number of Color Memories rounds from 10 to 8.Added particles to the charging animation.Added a new cursor.Increased the lobby radio volume slightly.Updated the scoring system for Team Mode.Updated the Team Mode score UI.Added a Discord button and logo to the m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T13:48:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3503350-1833334318579630","game_id":"steam-3503350","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Out !","summary":"The demo is finally available!Get ready to dive into the woolly madness and discover a preview of the chaos awaiting you. Please note that the demo content is limited:10 minigames availableNo cosmetics, only basic colorsNo coin rewards or cosmetic unlocksSteam achievements disabledThe demo will remain available until the official Early Access release in 2026.If you encounter bugs, issues, or would like to help im